# The Windows runtime files droidtop builds into the APK but does not build
# itself (docs/SPEC.md 9, "The runtime's native code and the files it does not
# build"; Droidtop/tracker#857). Each is re-hosted unmodified as an asset of
# the windows-runtime release of Droidtop/droidtop-components
# (sources/mirror.json there says where it came from and its licence).
# build-scripts/fetch-windows-runtime-components.sh puts each at its path
# under runtime-windows/components/ and refuses any other bytes.
#
# <path under components/> <sha256> <maker's URL, tried when our copy is not there>
